WEBVTT

00:00:12.520 --> 00:00:14.320
We have a winner!

00:00:14.740 --> 00:00:16.760
Congratulations!

00:00:19.300 --> 00:00:20.310
I got it…

00:00:20.310 --> 00:00:22.630
That’s right, the third prize!{or just third prize, idk how this stuff is done}

00:00:22.630 --> 00:00:26.740
Let’s see, third prize is… Which one was it?

00:00:26.740 --> 00:00:28.590
Ah, here it is!

00:00:28.590 --> 00:00:30.100
Tada!

00:00:30.100 --> 00:00:32.720
These are the best of their kind, and they come as a set!{These are the best of their kind, and they come as a set}

00:00:32.720 --> 00:00:34.720
Isn’t that great!?

00:00:35.030 --> 00:00:36.930
<i>Afterwards, I came to think,</i>

00:00:37.400 --> 00:00:43.260
<i>“These are definitely gifts for Asu and me from Mom in heaven”.</i>

00:00:47.880 --> 00:00:49.320
I’m home.

00:00:49.620 --> 00:00:53.070
Welcome home, Onee-chan. Thanks for all your hard work.

00:00:53.070 --> 00:00:55.040
Breakfast is ready!

00:00:55.040 --> 00:00:56.200
Thanks…

00:00:59.480 --> 00:01:01.780
So tired…

00:01:07.160 --> 00:01:08.440
Sorry.

00:01:08.860 --> 00:01:11.440
That’s fine. Are you okay, Onee-chan?

00:01:11.440 --> 00:01:12.180
Yeah.

00:01:13.980 --> 00:01:16.570
I’m just spacing out a little.

00:01:16.960 --> 00:01:18.300
This won’t do.

00:01:19.480 --> 00:01:22.060
I’m going to go wash my face. I’ll be right back.

00:01:31.900 --> 00:01:33.280
Onee-chan.

00:01:34.810 --> 00:01:37.860
I guess it’s bad manners to be yawning out in public, huh?

00:01:37.860 --> 00:01:39.300
No, that’s not what I meant…

00:01:39.300 --> 00:01:41.400
Hey, I’m fine, I’m fine.{everything’s fine}

00:01:41.400 --> 00:01:43.080
Well, I’ll see you later. I’m off.

00:01:43.660 --> 00:01:47.040
Hey, be careful and don’t forget to check before crossing the street, okay?{was just too short snapped to keyframe}

00:01:47.040 --> 00:01:49.080
Yeah, I’ll be fine!

00:01:50.480 --> 00:01:53.380
I guess I’m making Asu worry about me again.

00:01:53.380 --> 00:01:55.320
I have to try harder.

00:01:55.940 --> 00:02:00.550
<i>Ever since the paper boy
from the next district quit,</i>

00:02:01.280 --> 00:02:06.020
<i>I’ve been extra busy filling in for him until they find a replacement.{attaching gender pronouns unnecessarily.}</i>

00:02:07.050 --> 00:02:08.140
Oh, hey, Asu!

00:02:11.420 --> 00:02:13.940
<i>I forgot to tell her again.</i>

00:02:13.940 --> 00:02:17.470
The pickled cucumbers she made for breakfast were really tasty.

00:02:23.160 --> 00:02:25.950
The third prize!

00:02:25.950 --> 00:02:27.540
Congratulations, Asu-chan!

00:02:27.540 --> 00:02:31.360
This is the third prize! It comes as a set!{tapdancing jesus christ, now is not the time to be second-guessing translations}

00:02:31.860 --> 00:02:33.780
Premium, prepaid cell phones!

00:02:33.780 --> 00:02:35.300
The SIM cards are included.

00:02:35.300 --> 00:02:38.100
Now, let’s get that bagged up for you.{why does this guy look so creepy}

00:02:38.100 --> 00:02:40.500
C-Can I really have these?

00:02:40.500 --> 00:02:41.530
Of course!

00:02:53.260 --> 00:02:57.100
Mom went to heaven the year Asu was born.

00:02:57.450 --> 00:03:00.780
Dad disappeared after accumulating gambling debts.

00:03:01.400 --> 00:03:04.600
Thus, we were abandoned.

00:03:05.760 --> 00:03:09.770
This is a 40-year-old, one-room,
dilapidated apartment with no bath.

00:03:09.770 --> 00:03:12.220
This is our home.

00:03:12.220 --> 00:03:14.700
But, when spring comes…

